# Verse & explore data

- Verse `id` format: `{chapter}-{verse_number}` (e.g. `2-47`, `16-1-3`).
- Chapter files: `data/verses/chapters/chapter-NN.ts`; catalog: `data/verses/verse-catalog.ts`.
- Explore topics: `data/explore-categories.ts`. Topic art/icons: `constants/topic-icons.ts` + `assets/images/topic-*-bg.png` / `icon-*.png`.
- Every category verse ID must exist in `VERSE_ID_SET` (`lib/verse-id-registry.ts`).
- After category or ID changes, run `__tests__/category-verse-ids.test.ts` (or `npm run test`).
- Keep Telugu sloka / meaning / commentary fields consistent with the `Verse` type in `types/verse.ts`.
- Audio maps via `data/verses/verse-audio.ts` and `audio-mapper.ts` — update when adding playable verses.
